ecked against the skills\n  taxonomy, so nothing is invented).\n- Fixes the skills editor showing sample skills (Java, Spring Boot, React...)\n  for every resume, and hiding a saved flat skills list that has no categories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:40:55-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-FE-vite/commit/071d0cac846c6575111b43448f5df56595deecbf","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T16:40:55-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T16:40:55-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/components/components/private/resume-builder/editors/basics/HeadlineAiAssist.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/editors/experience/RoleAiAssist.tsx","src/utils/resume-linkedin-import.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["src/components/components/private/resume-builder/ResumeLinkedInImportModal.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/ConsultantMyResumesView.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/editors/BasicsSectionEditor.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/editors/ExperienceSectionEditor.tsx","src/components/components/private/resume-builder/editors/SkillsSectionEditor.tsx","src/constants/resume-builder.ts","src/services/resume.ts","src/utils/resume-builder-skills.ts"]},{"id":"5a37d60ca890c18bda73038b12b6860ad7b39b74","tree_id":"62effd9347958f9155ceef1ed9ed0fef8190fbae","distinct":true,"message":"fix(resume-builder): contain Stripe checkout failures inside the dialog\n\nAn invalid publishable key or client secret made Stripe.js throw during render\nand took the whole page down. The checkout now has its own error boundary and\na Payment Element load-error handler. Found by running the flow against a local\nStripe mock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:52:55-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-FE-vite/commit/5a37d60ca890c18bda73038b12b6860ad7b39b74","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T16:52:55-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T16:52:55-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/CreditCheckout.tsx"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"5a37d60ca890c18bda73038b12b6860ad7b39b74","tree_id":"62effd9347958f9155ceef1ed9ed0fef8190fbae","distinct":true,"message":"fix(resume-builder): contain Stripe checkout failures inside the dialog\n\nAn invalid publishable key or client secret made Stripe.js throw during render\nand took the whole page down. The checkout now has its own error boundary and\na Payment Element load-error handler. Found by running the flow against a local\nStripe mock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:52:55-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-FE-vite/commit/5a37d60ca890c18bda73038b12b6860ad7b39b74","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T16:52:55-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-12T16:52:55-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["src/components/components/private/resume-builder/consultant/CreditCheckout.tsx"]}}
